  "description": "The Sentinel 750 is the Class-3 eBike trusted by the LAPD—built for speed, stability, and all-day duty performance. Developed over five years alongside officers in the field, this high-speed pedelec is engineered for tactical response, extended patrols, and superior rider ergonomics. Its high-clearance frame, rugged components, and integrated law enforcement features make it ideal for those who demand more from their eBike. Motor and Battery\nMotor: Bosch Performance Line Speed Smart System motor with 85 Nm of torque, delivering powerful pedal assist up to 28 mph for rapid deployment in any urban setting.\nBattery: Bosch PowerTube 750 Wh battery delivers long-range support for full-day patrols—up to 8 hours of consistent performance. Recharges fully in approximately 6 hours. Suspension and Frame\nFork: SR Suntour Lytro 36 Supreme SL Boost with 120mm of travel to handle curbs, alleys, and mixed terrain with control and comfort.\nFrame: Durable 6061 aluminum with internal cable routing and a specially designed high top tube to prevent duty belts from catching on the saddle. Available in 41 / 44 / 48 / 54 / 60 cm sizes. Drivetrain and Brakes\nGears: Shimano 11-speed drivetrain ensures reliable, smooth shifting in high-stress riding conditions.\nBrakes: Magura MT-5 (4-piston) front and MT-4 (2-piston) rear hydraulic disc brakes with 203mm / 180mm rotors for fast, consistent stopping power. Wheels and Tires\nTires: Maxxis Rekon 27.5 x 2.6\" tires provide outstanding grip and durability across pavement, dirt, and mixed urban terrain. Additional Features\nPolice-Optimized Rack: Integrated Topeak rack system supports a custom Topeak police bag with Velcro side panels displaying \"POLICE\" markings.\nTactical Design: Matte black stealth finish ideal for low-visibility and nighttime patrols.\nCommunity Engagement: Enhances officer approachability and coverage with silent, agile mobility. Technology and Performance\nClass-3 eBike: Pedal-assist up to 28 mph for faster coverage and quicker response.\nBoost Hub + Thru Axle: Maximized strength and stiffness for high-performance riding in demanding urban environments.\nDeveloped for professionals, trusted by the LAPD. The Sentinel 750 is more than a bike—it’s a patrol-ready partner built for performance, safety, and modern policing.",
